              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Amasia olayioni le Yoash olaiguanani le Yuda nebik ilarin tomon o imiet etulusoyie keeya e Yoash olayioni le Yehoahas, olaiguanani loo Siraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa nkulie kiaasin e Amasia, ebaiki enkiterunoto o metabaiki enkiting'oto, neigeroki too mbukui oo laiguanak le Yuda o Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ebaiki ina kata apa naibelekenye ninye apaash Olaitoriani, neitobir ninche pee ear ninye metua te Yerusalem. Neisikaki ninye Lakish. Kake etusujakita ninche ninye Lakish, near ninye metua teine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ninche ninye too mbartan. Nenukari tenebo loo menye te nkanasa e Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.28",
